Package: confideR
Title: Protect Confidential Fisheries Data When Using AI Coding Assistants
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("James", "Smith", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "james.a.smith@dpi.nsw.gov.au",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
Description: Provides tools to protect confidential fisheries data during
    AI-assisted code development. Enforces a 'confidential mode' that clears
    AI API keys, blocks AI-adjacent R packages, and gates data loading.
    Audits the current IDE (RStudio, Positron, VS Code) for active AI
    features. Generates privacy-safe data schemas ('fingerprints') from
    real datasets without exposing raw values. Simulates realistic fisheries
    CPUE data for safe use with AI coding assistants, supporting the
    'develop on simulated data, run on real data' workflow.
